[{"title":"次沈陶庵题石田有竹庄韵","author":"定徵","text":"移家种竹杨湖上，半似湘川半辋川。\n诗好日尝题节下，酒酣时复卧根边。\n扫门延客还开径，煮笋供茶或试泉。\n我记别来今十载，出林添得几梢烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":296,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次沈陶庵题石田有竹庄韵","author":"善诱","text":"江南隐者人不识，沈东林胜杜樊川。\n云深树老空山里，日暮舟横野渡边。\n绕屋苎长迷曲径，当门花落就流泉。\n一藤来果敲诗约，坐断炉头榾柮烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":297,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次沈陶庵题石田有竹庄韵","author":"广原","text":"卜得幽居地势偏，风光别是一山川。\n白鸥新水钩帘外，乌目斜阳拄颊边。\n绕屋比邻留野竹，清心琴筑倚寒泉。\n隔溪西崦禅林近，尝听钟声出暮烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":298,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张题张果老骑驴图","author":"果庵","text":"举世多少人，无如这老汉。\n不是倒骑驴，凡事回头看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":299,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松雪山水","author":"古渊","text":"雪后潮痕上钓矶，江南天水一丝微。\n萋萋芳草迷禾黍，何事王孙尚不归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":300,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居志感 其一","author":"永瑛","text":"江鸥只驯水，野鹤不受笼。\n孰云游方士，肯为尘所蒙。\n风清紫芝谷，月白青莲峰。\n学道岁未晚，寻师吾远从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":301,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居志感 其二","author":"永瑛","text":"嘉蔬值我园，好鸟巢我树。\n树枯鸟惊栖，园荒蔬委路。\n寒气肃山林，新芳飒然故。\n物理有固然，于何起欣恶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":302,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻潮","author":"永瑛","text":"闲倚青松读古诗，杭标霅昼旧相知。\n山僧不刻莲花漏，潮白江门报午时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":303,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿梦石房","author":"永瑛","text":"坐久青灯结晕红，纸窗寒逗落花风。\n西斋试与吟春草，夜半开门月正中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":304,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安坝河道中","author":"戒襄","text":"三月临平山下宿，沙棠一舟帆数幅。\n清晨鼓枻看山行，两岸人家春水绿。\n岸上人家挂酒旗，几树桃花映修竹。\n路人问我将何之，我欲寻师向天目。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":305,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王十岳金平渊山寮避暑","author":"果斌","text":"小隐空山绝四邻，野云孤鹤自相亲。\n谁知一径深如许，犹有敲门看竹人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":306,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还壶关","author":"明周","text":"林花未吐怯轻寒，人在天涯送客还。\n千里好山迎马首，白云飞处是壶关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":307,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都门除夕","author":"明周","text":"早眠轻节序，垂老倦精神。\n半夜两年梦，孤灯千里身。\n钵分新岁饭，衣拂旧时尘。\n后饮屠苏者，其如感叹频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":308,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴山人","author":"方泽","text":"落叶满江边，秋风急暮蝉。\n我思天姥寺，君上洞庭船。\n束帛丘园少，徵兵泽国连。\n不知方处士，炼药几时仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":309,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚午除夕","author":"方泽","text":"何处鼓逢逢，虚堂独坐中。\n雨寒还带雪，云厚不随风。\n此岁既消去，馀生宁未空。\n临阶看燎火，亦复趁儿童。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":310,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西天目高峰塔院","author":"方泽","text":"千丈岩扉不易登，真身长綍最高层。\n日中乍见驯檐鸟，云外时逢礼塔僧。\n行道石边纷异草，挂衣松上绾长藤。\n青年即有栖迟约，白首谁知尚未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":311,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜对雪","author":"方泽","text":"江城燎火正凝霞，密雪旋迷十万家。\n却向垆边飞作雨，偶经灯畔落成花。\n力侵衣絮心同冷，光映窗纱发并华。\n诘旦祝禧先有瑞，会从龙象曳袈裟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":312,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"方泽","text":"平时怀独往，垂老患馀身。\n林蔚常疑晚，山暄每过春。\n月来初有客，云去乍无邻。\n独喜阶前鸟，忘机旦暮驯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":313,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀吴西洲","author":"方泽","text":"枫落吴江雁影斜，燕京游客未还家。\n可能别有春风在，不怕秋霜两鬓华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":314,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送玄岳入京","author":"方泽","text":"故人多半在燕京，病里逢君话北征。\n可是秋来无定力，千重离思一时生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":315,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪庄即事","author":"方泽","text":"寒逼西堂布被重，江头枫叶想应红。\n天明自起看霜色，不在江头在镜中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":316,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京春暮寄山中人 其一","author":"正念","text":"鸟鸣不鸣山静，花落未落春迟。\n美人如云天际，芍药空留一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":317,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京春暮寄山中人 其二","author":"正念","text":"蚕熟柔桑更绿，莺啼小麦初黄。\n吃饼且随燕蓟，缲丝空忆荆杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":318,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起","author":"明旷","text":"几点星犹在树，成群鸦已出村。\n最是依微梵火，居然掩映松门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":319,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六咏诗 其一 心","author":"德清","text":"金翅鸟命终，骨肉尽消散。\n唯有心不化，圆明光灿烂。\n龙王取为珠，照破诸黑暗。\n转轮得如意，能救一切难。\n如何在人中，日用而不见？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":320,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六咏诗 其二 无常","author":"德清","text":"法性本无常，亦不堕诸数。\n譬彼空中云，当体即常住。\n圣凡皆过客，去来无二路。\n是生不是生，非新亦非故。\n智眼明见人，此外何所慕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":321,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六咏诗 其三 苦","author":"德清","text":"梦入大火聚，怕怖多慞惶。\n正当苦恼时，滴水便清凉。\n水尽火复然，念慕何慨慷。\n及至醒眼观，向者谁悲伤？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":322,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六咏诗 其四 空","author":"德清","text":"须弥横太虚，大地浮香海。\n六尘蔽性天，四大遍法界。\n劫火洞然时，此个坏不坏。\n何必待烧尽，然后无障碍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":323,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六咏诗 其五 无我","author":"德清","text":"一水作众味，酸咸苦辣具。\n以本淡然故，而能成众事。\n若实不随者，安肯随他去。\n唯有不随者，谁能识此趣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":324,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六咏诗 其六 生死","author":"德清","text":"生死不流转，流转非生死。\n若实不流转，生死无穷已。\n谛观流转性，流转当下止。\n不见流转心，是真出生死。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":325,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采珠行","author":"德清","text":"灼灼明月珠，产向深渊底。\n从空捞摝之，鱼龙尽惊起。\n鲛人相抱泣，洒泪忽成雨。\n腥风扑远岸，鲸波奔万里。\n密网垂天云，轻帆展鹏翼。\n一擘川后愁，再击海若徙。\n尽剖蚌蛤腹，不补苍赤髓。\n安得如意珠，持归报天子。\n神光发中夜，龙颜大欣喜。\n七宝随所求，四事尽丰美。\n展转济孤贫，利乐无穷已。\n用赏战胜功，传为灌顶祉。\n罢此批鳞役，聊以释附髀。\n沧海不扬波，沟渎清尘滓。\n愿祝吾皇寿，量同东海水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":326,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸卯初度自五羊之曹溪舟中作","author":"德清","text":"今朝五十八，明日五十九。\n未来不可思，过去何所有。\n世相空里花，毁誉镜中丑。\n不推羊鹿车，喜随牛马走。\n自愧膝穿芦，却怪肘生柳。\n发散少冠束，面厚多尘垢。\n战退生死军，打碎无明臼。\n使尽老婆心，笑破虚空口。\n两岸既不容，中流非所守。\n来往任风波，去住绝偕耦。\n天际望长安，寒空一回首。\n回首问时人，谁是侬家友。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":327,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄钱太史受之","author":"德清","text":"匡庐列云霄，江湖邈天际。\n地涌青莲华，枝叶相鲜丽。\n眷彼华中人，超然隔尘世。\n梦想五十年，良缘图未遂。\n偶乘空中云，随风至吴会。\n东南美山水，蕴藉多佳士。\n一见素心人，精神恍如醉。\n未语肝胆倾，清言入微细。\n相对形骸忘，了然脱拘忌。\n精白出世心，太虚信可誓。\n苦海方洪波，愿言驾津济。\n把别向河梁，遂我归山志。\n长揖返匡庐，藏踪杳深邃。\n五老与七贤，日夜常瞻对。\n诛茅卧空山，烟霞为衣被。\n视此芭蕉身，一掷如弃涕。\n缅想未归人，驰情劳梦寐。\n安得驾长虹，凌风倏然至。\n暂谢尘世缘，入我真三昧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":328,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"担板汉歌","author":"德清","text":"担板汉，担板汉，如何被他苦相赚。\n只图肩头轻，不顾脚跟绊。\n纵饶担到未生前，早已被他遮一半。\n这片板，项上枷，浑身骨肉都属他。\n若不快便早抛却，百千万劫真冤家。\n行也累，坐也累，明明障碍何不会？\n只为当初错认真，清门净户生妖魅。\n开眼见，闭眼见，白日太虚生闪电。\n乾闼婆城影现空，痴儿认作天宫殿。\n要得轻，须放下，臭死虾蟆争甚价。\n乌豆将来换眼睛，鱼目应须辨真假。\n有条路，最好行，坦坦荡荡如天平。\n但不留连傍花柳，管取他年入帝京。\n舍身命，如大地，牛马驼驴不须避。\n果能一掷过须弥，剑树刀山如儿戏。\n若爱他，被他害，累赘多因费管带。\n一朝打破琉璃瓶，大地山河都粉碎。\n我劝君，不必担，髑髅有汁当下乾。\n分身散影百千亿，从今不入死生关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":329,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军诗三首丙申春二月入五羊三月十日抵雷阳戍所作 其一","author":"德清","text":"旧说雷阳道，今过电白西。\n万山岚气合，一锡瘴烟迷。\n末路随蓬累，残生信马蹄。\n那堪深树里，处处鹧鸪啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":330,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军诗三首丙申春二月入五羊三月十日抵雷阳戍所作 其二","author":"德清","text":"窜逐辞金地，穷荒到海涯。\n云容飞赤鸟，星尾曳丹蛇。\n弃杖林成久，挥戈日未斜。\n天南并塞北，是处有胡笳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":331,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从军诗三首丙申春二月入五羊三月十日抵雷阳戍所作 其三","author":"德清","text":"万壑奔流下，千山紫翠连。\n帆飞三峡雨，人入九秋天。\n客路浮云外，归心落日前。\n吾生犹未已，江汉是馀年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":332,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿清溪驿梦得草虫鸣断岸沙鸟宿寒汀之句因续成诗","author":"德清","text":"溯流遵远渚，旅泊傍孤亭。\n月隐山容淡，鱼潜水气腥。\n草虫鸣断岸，沙鸟宿寒汀。\n最惜飘零者，浮生梦未醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":333,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚子岁书事 其一","author":"德清","text":"豺虎中原遍，星轺日夜驰。\n诏无哀痛字，人有向隅悲。\n远探骊龙窟，深批弱木枝。\n乾坤聊俯仰，愁绝一双眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":334,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚子岁书事 其二","author":"德清","text":"青海初收捷，朱厓始罢征。\n剑门飞赤羽，阁道走羌兵。\n帝德怀柔远，王师耻战争。\n蛮夷应系长，不见请长缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":335,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚子岁书事 其三","author":"德清","text":"满目黄尘暗，披肩白发垂。\n江湖归路杳，鸥鹭傍人疑。\n康济思今日，安危望此时。\n从来貂珥重，宁不愧恩私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":336,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸卯春日大廉即事","author":"德清","text":"炎方风物异，岁事总难期。\n腊尽虫无蛰，春来鸟不知。\n豆花开旧荚，榕叶落新枝。\n因忆燕山雪，阳和似有私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":337,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中示诸子","author":"德清","text":"厌世心成癖，那堪病作魔。\n已知馀日少，更见此身多。\n药石充香积，呻吟当羯磨。\n文殊如有问，一默竟如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":338,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿桥口","author":"德清","text":"落照浸湖天，沙明月在船。\n鸟栖临水树，人语隔林烟。\n浮世止一宿，馀生能几年。\n如何衰暮日，犹滞楚江边？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":339,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居","author":"德清","text":"发不如心白，形还似木枯。\n众缘闲处尽，一念看来孤。\n天已容疏拙，禅应离有无。\n馀生当落日，步步是归途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":340,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"德清","text":"湘水通巴汉，孤帆入楚天。\n片云低远树，晴日照斜川。\n处世常如寄，浮生莫问年。\n纵遵归去路，亦似渡头船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":341,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙申二月抵广州寓海珠寺","author":"德清","text":"天涯历尽尚遐征，百粤风烟不计程。\n涉险始知尘海阔，道穷转见死生轻。\n暂依水月光明住，偶向琉璃宝地行。\n到岸舟航今已弃，上方钟鼓为谁鸣？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":342,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄燕都慈寿寺别山长老","author":"德清","text":"当年一钵久过从，长夜披衣听晓钟。\n饭食每怀香积界，经行常忆妙高峰。\n潜消瘴热心含雪，暗记流年手种松。\n为扫莲花师子座，待馀重举绝言宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":343,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居二首 其一","author":"德清","text":"三冬拥衲坐枯禅，喜见春光最可怜。\n瓦鼎野蔬将献供，地垆松火渐无烟。\n青山覆雪重开面，白发防寒已及肩。\n幸作太平云卧客，焚香朝暮祝尧年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":344,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居二首 其二","author":"德清","text":"旧游恍忽是前生，每忆行藏暗著惊。\n此日青山当日梦，今时白社旧时盟。\n酬机但用无星秤，娱老唯留折脚铛。\n若问西来端的意，曹溪一派水盈盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":345,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画小景 其一","author":"德清","text":"流云覆春山，轻寒冻欲坼。\n何处踏青来，归时月华白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":346,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画小景 其二","author":"德清","text":"烟树春云绿，江天落日红。\n不知何处醉，归向月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":347,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再过小金山","author":"德清","text":"渔火夜深白，沙鸡清昼喧。\n江空人境绝，长日掩柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":348,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对月","author":"德清","text":"雪岭孤松老，曹溪滴水寒。\n谁知今夜月，犹是昔时看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":349,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀五台旧居","author":"德清","text":"叶斗峰头雪未消，别来音信久寥寥。\n炎方屡梦经行处，曳杖闲过独木桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":350,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登南安城","author":"德清","text":"城头瓣瓣涌青莲，花蕊香含万户烟。\n身在境中人不识，更于此外觅诸天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":351,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居偶成 其一","author":"德清","text":"百年世事空华里，一片身心水月间。\n独许万山深密处，昼长趺坐掩松关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":352,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居偶成 其二","author":"德清","text":"滚滚红尘世路长，不知何事走他乡。\n回头日望家山远，满目空云带夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":353,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居偶成 其三","author":"德清","text":"闹蓝谁肯急抽身，自古青山隔市尘。\n莫谓桃源无路入，落花流水是知津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":354,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居偶成 其四","author":"德清","text":"日夜烟霞护翠微，相将猿鹤待忘机。\n青山莫道闲无主，自是闲人不肯归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":355,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其一","author":"德清","text":"夜深独坐事枯禅，拨尽寒灰火不然。\n忽听楼头钟磬发，一声清韵满霜天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":356,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其二","author":"德清","text":"万峰深处独跏趺，历历虚明一念孤。\n身似寒空挂明月，唯馀清影落江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":357,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其四","author":"德清","text":"雪拥柴扉独坐时，寒林寸寸折琼枝。\n晓来顿失青山色，开尽梅花总不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":358,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其五","author":"德清","text":"身心放下有馀闲，垂老生涯在万山。\n不许白云轻出谷，好随明月护柴关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":359,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其六","author":"德清","text":"寒灯独照影微微，疏屋风吹雪满衣。\n忽忆五台趺坐处，万年冰里一柴扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":360,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居 其七","author":"德清","text":"寒威入骨千峰雪，怒气冲人万窍风。\n衲被蒙头初睡醒，不知身在寂寥中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":361,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牢山访憨山清公不值","author":"真可","text":"吾道沈冥久，谁倡齐鲁风。\n闲来居海北，名误落山东。\n水接田横岛，云连慧炬峰。\n相寻不相见，踏遍法身中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":362,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登那罗延窟","author":"真可","text":"菩萨僧常住，归依上翠微。\n山高疑日近，海阔觉天低。\n岛屿屏中国，波涛限外夷。\n重来防失路，拂石一留题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":363,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楞严废寺","author":"真可","text":"万花丛里画楼新，玉女凭栏天上春。\n明月一轮帘外冷，夜深曾照坐禅人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":364,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]